# What never belongs in a build context.
#
# node_modules is the one that matters. pnpm installs it as links into a content
# addressed store, and copying that from the host puts links pointing at paths the
# container does not have on top of the install the image just did. The result is a build
# that fails to resolve a dependency it demonstrably installed, which reads like anything
# except what it is.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Built output is rebuilt inside the image, and a host build carries the host's platform.
dist
**/dist

.git
.github
**/*.log
